{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SYRUP 2: CANDY ALCHEMY RPG</strong> is a direct sequel to my 2015 visual novel, Syrup and the Ultimate Sweet. As the title implies, the series has evolved into a fully featured RPG! Synthesize candies, battle monsters, and complete quests while discovering more about the world beyond Atelier Sweets!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ candy recipes to synthesize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique enemies and heart-pounding boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 recruitable party members to bond with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ hours to clear the main story (~60k word count)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest appearances from other NomnomNami games (Lonely Wolf Treat, her tears were my light, BAD END THEATER)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CANDY ALCHEMY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syrup is a Candy Alchemist, which means she can synthesize all sorts of wonderful sweets for her friends and customers to enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique ingredients from around the world. Bring a friend along to gather even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you return home, spend the evening crafting unique confections! Gumdrop will praise every one of your new creations~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/eed237a8e1eacda707b17da17de422cb.poster.avif?t=1761924394\" width=1272 height=714 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/eed237a8e1eacda707b17da17de422cb.webm?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/eed237a8e1eacda707b17da17de422cb.mp4?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syrup and her friends will sometimes run into trouble during their adventures... Kick these magical enemies into submission and collect their parts to make more delicious candy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The candies you craft can be used to aid you in battle. They'll give you everything from quick stat buffs to full revivals! Eating enough candy will make you unstoppable!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience to level up, and your stats will grow even higher. Wow, Syrup, you're so strong~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/4fc83092533f102e6c5dae513c2352b7.poster.avif?t=1761924394\" width=1268 height=710 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/4fc83092533f102e6c5dae513c2352b7.webm?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/4fc83092533f102e6c5dae513c2352b7.mp4?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is it really okay to play the sequel first...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made to be fun for fans both new and old! It's a title you can enjoy even if you've never played a single NomnomNami game before. I hope you'll fall in love with the characters in this world!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946750?t=1761924394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946750?t=1761924394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/1ba0592558ade94d3e39f406b5849550e15067c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761924394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s