ents from around the world. Bring a friend along to gather even more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you return home, spend the evening crafting unique confections! Gumdrop will praise every one of your new creations~</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/eed237a8e1eacda707b17da17de422cb.poster.avif?t=1761924394\" width=1272 height=714 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/eed237a8e1eacda707b17da17de422cb.webm?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/eed237a8e1eacda707b17da17de422cb.mp4?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syrup and her friends will sometimes run into trouble during their adventures... Kick these magical enemies into submission and collect their parts to make more delicious candy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The candies you craft can be used to aid you in battle. They'll give you everything from quick stat buffs to full revivals! Eating enough candy will make you unstoppable!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience to level up, and your stats will grow even higher. Wow, Syrup, you're so strong~!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/4fc83092533f102e6c5dae513c2352b7.poster.avif?t=1761924394\" width=1268 height=710 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/4fc83092533f102e6c5dae513c2352b7.webm?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/extras/4fc83092533f102e6c5dae513c2352b7.mp4?t=1761924394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is it really okay to play the sequel first...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made to be fun for fans both new and old! It's a title you can enjoy even if you've never played a single NomnomNami game before. I hope you'll fall in love with the characters in this world!</p>","developers":["NomnomNami"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946750/c4634a8d4ef268434766833150276cc0bfeed80f/header.jpg?t=1761924394","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible (Apple silicon supported through Rosetta 2)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946750/257291437/d51832e6d5f3f7230f86fa28921fffdc5edbc418/1755390527/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755706042","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946750/257291437/d51832e6d5f3f7230f86fa28921fffdc5edbc418/1755390527/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755706042","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946750/257291437/d51832e